{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cCBK-10pJANXLqksrfGsVg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:46.805152+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cCBK-10pJANXLqksrfGsVg","html":"<div><p><span><span><span>东北大学地质学科历史悠久，建立于上世纪</span></span></span><span><span><span>50</span></span></span><span><span><span>年代初。通过多年来的建设和发展，</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>矿产普查与勘探</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>学科成为国内最早获准硕士学位（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1981</span></span></span><span><span><span>年）和第三批博士学位（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1986</span></span></span><span><span><span>年）授予权的学科，</span></span></span><span><span><span>1991</span></span></span><span><span><span>年又获准建立</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>地质资源与地质工程</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>博士后流动站，</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>矿产普查与勘探</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>于</span></span></span><span><span><span>2003</span></span></span><span><span><span>年被辽宁省评为省级重点学科。同年</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>地球探测与信息技术</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>学科被批准为具有硕士学位授予权的学科。在此基础上，地质资源与地质工程学科于</span></span></span><span><span><span>2011</span></span></span><span><span><span>年获批为一级学科硕士点，</span></span></span><span><span><span>2018</span></span></span><span><span><span>年获批为一级学科博士点。近年来，本学科通过国家</span></span></span><span><span><span>“211</span></span></span><span><span><span>工程</span></span></span><span><span><span>”</span></span></span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>“985</span></span></span><span><span><span>工程</span></span></span><span><span><span>”、</span></span></span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>双一流</span></span></span><span><span><span>”以及省重点学科的建设与支持，进一步拓展和凝练了学科方向，形成了具有特色的学科优势。本学科具有独立培养高质量高层次人才的能力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>本学科聚焦于基础地质前沿领域和国家战略性金属矿产资源成矿规律与预测研究、面向深部矿产开发和地质灾害防治等国家重大需求，立足东北矿业经济与可持续发展战略，形成了三个主要研究方向：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）</span></span><b><span><span>矿产普查与勘探</span></span></b></span><span><span><span>主要研究领域有成矿规律及找矿预测、资源勘查技术与方法</span></span><span><span><span>、区域成矿背景与地质环境演化</span></span></span><span><span>、尾矿资源综合利用。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）</span></span><b><span><span>地质工程</span></span></b></span><b></b><span><span><span>主要研究领域有地质灾害防治理论及应用、工程地质体稳定性分析、工程地质及水文地质。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）</span></span><b><span><span>地球探测与信息技术</span></span></b></span><b></b><span><span><span>主要研究领域有矿产资源勘查与评价信息技术、勘查地球物理方法与应用、地质灾害预警及防治、地下水资源评价及环境地球化学。</span></span></span><b></b></p><p><span><span><span>地质资源与地质工程学科导师情况：http://www.zitu.neu.edu.cn/987/list.htm</span></span></span></p><p></p></div>","textSha256":"a24970495080d595d1bee2c45ebe67ab9b71f946dd5b36a75e2347bdd0fad920","textLength":641,"sourceSha256":"26c7aee8840c0b8efda3292767b72a2266cbee123b16fd46890ac667dca902fa","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5c0135ebd8595bef83ab","title":"2026年东北大学资源与土木工程学院地质系地质资源与地质工程学科接收预推免考生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:46.805152+00:00"}
